<title>USA: Duff assigns Reliance A plus claims rating.</title>
<headline>Duff assigns Reliance A plus claims rating.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Duff &amp; Phelps Credit Rating Co said it has assigned a claims paying ability rating of A plus to Reliance Insurance Co Group.</p>
<p>Duff also assigned a parent company senior debt rating of double B plus and a subordinated debt rating of double B.</p>
<p>Reliance Insurance is a unit of Reliance Group Holdings Inc.</p>
